<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="TIT" style="id">- Lugulu Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa Tito</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tito</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tit</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ibaluwa ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tito</para>
  <para style="iot">Ichilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Tito cha chitabu chimwe mna pfitabu pfine pfa Pauli pfayamwandikile imunu yumwe yumwe na si kwa likanisa bae. Na pfitabu pfingi pfidatu apfino hano, Ibaluwa ya mwanduso kwa Timoteo, na ya keli kwa Timoteo, na ibaluwa kwa Filimoni. Ibaluwa ino Pauli tsakamwandikila Tito, ila tsakayandika ka yobamighwa isomighwe hambele he iwanu. Pauli tsakayandika mna miyaka ya sitini na tatu mbaka sitini na tano kulawa Yesu hakalile muisi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pauli komlaghitsa Tito yalilongotse makanisa ighakalile mne chisiwa cha Kirete. Pauli kamwandikila ibaluwa ino ili yamlangulitse Tito mna kuwasaghula na kuwalangulitsa pfilongotsi wa makanisa, na ghayamlongele mne ibaluwa ino gheghala na aghala ghalongile mna tsibaluwa tsake mbili tsayamwandikile Timoteo. Pfipfila Pauli kolonga pfilongotsi wa likanisa wobamighwa wawetse. Apfo pfilongotsi wa likanisa wa leloli walole ighali mne ibaluwa ino ili wawe pfilongotsi wanoghile.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ighali mchitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 1:1-16, Pauli komlangulitsa Tito yawasaghule pfilongotsi iwompfuka Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 2:1-3:11, komlaghitsa yawalangulitse iwanu wakale kwa ukumpfuka Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="io">Mne isula ya 3:12-15 Pauli komalitsila.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Nene Pauli mtumwa we Imulungu na mtumighwa wa Kiristu Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Tsanisaghulighwa na kutumighwa ukwapfila inoghola ye iwanu iwasaghulighwe ne Imulungu na kuwalongotsa wamanye ukweli wa kukala ka pfobama Imulungu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ukweli uno wotwing'a lolelo lya ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose, Imulungu ing'alongagha ughutsu bae tsakalapfa laghano kulawa ng'ana isi ilumbighwe, <verse number="3" style="v"/>na mne chipindi chinoghile kaughubula mna imbuli yake. Nene tsaning'ighwa imbuli ayo niipete kwa laghitso lye Imulungu Mkombotsi wetu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nokwandikila ghweghwe Tito, mwanangu ghendo yatuhangila inoghola imwe. Nomlomba Aba Imulungu na Kiristu Yesu Mkombotsi wetu yakutendele uluso na yakwike tseghamba.</para>
  <para style="s">Sang'ano ya Tito akula Kirete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Tsanikuleka Kirete ili wike pfinoghile chila chinu ichihunguke na uwasaghule iwabala iwolongotsa iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu chila mne ghumji, ka pfanikulaghitse. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Mbala yolongotsa iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu kobamighwa yawe imunu yalihela totso, yawe na mwehe yumwe, na iwanaghe wamtoghole Yesu, na waleke kumanyika kwa ughobo au kwa kuleka kuhulika. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kwaapfila mbala yowalolesa iwanu iwomtoghola Kiristu ka mwimilitsi we isang'ano ye Imulungu, yawe imunu iyalihela matotso. Aleke kwighoda, aleke kusumka kwona maya, aleke kupatika, aleke ughobo na aleke kusulukila ng'ani tsisendi. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Lekeni awe mluso na iyonoghela ghanoghile, awe mhole, awe imunu iyotenda ighamnogheletsa Imulungu, awe mwenzeluka na iyodaha kwilongotsa mwenyegho, <verse number="9" style="v"/>iyokindisa pfinoghile usenga ula wa kutogholighwa ka pfaulangulitsighwa. Apfo katsodaha kuwaghuma ghumoyo iwanu wangi kwa ghamalangulitso igholongesa na kuwahuma awala iwoghabela ghamalangulitso agho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mana kuna iwanu wengi ghendoghendo awala iwalawile mne kingili lya Wayahudi, awo iwolema kuhulika, iwolonga hela, na iwobugha iwanu wangi. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Waghomighwe waleke kulonga, kwaapfila wopfulughitsa kaye ngima kwa kulangulitsa ipfinu pfang'awobamighwa kupfilangulitsa, wotenda apfo ili wapate tsisendi. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hata nabii wawo yumwe, naye pfipfila ka Mkilete, tsakalonga, “Wakilete waghutsu ghamatsuwa ghose, wawo ka iwanyama wehile, wana batsu na wadebwe!” <verse number="13" style="v"/>Naye tsakalongesa, apfo uwakanye ghendo, ili weme pfinoghile mne inoghola. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Waleke kughendelela kukoleletsa simo tsiliheka tsa Wayahudi na ghamalaghitso igholawila kwe iwanu iwalemile ukweli. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kwa iwanu iwelile hambele he Imulungu, chila chinu chela, lekeni kuduhu chochose ichelile kwa awala iwehile na ing'awotoghola Imulungu, na uwetso wawo wo kusaghula kutenda ghanoghile au ghehile kuhinyika na tsimbutsi tsawo tsiha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Iwanu awo wolonga wommanya Imulungu, lekeni kwa ghamatendo ghawo womlema. Weha ghendo na ng'awohulika bae, ng'awotogholighwa bae kwa kutenda chinu chochose ichinoghile.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ghamalangulitso igholongesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lekeni ghweghwe ulonge ghamalangulitso igholongesa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Uwalongele wanzehe wawe na chiyasi, wawe iwotogholighwa ne wanu, wadahe kwilongotsa wenyegho, weme mne inoghola yawo na unoghelo na wadudumile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pfipfila uwalongele wapinga wanzehe wampfuke Imulungu, waleke kuwa waghutsu, waleke kunwa ng'ani mbwali, walangulitse aghala ighanoghile, <verse number="4" style="v"/>ili wawafunde wapinga wadowado kuwanoghela iwamale tsawo ne iwana wawo, <verse number="5" style="v"/>wadahe kwilongotsa wenyegho na wadeghete, walolese ghoya kaye tsawo, wanoghe na wawahulikitse wamale wawo, ili usenga we Imulungu uleke kulongighwa pfihile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pfipfila uwaghume ghumoyo iwasongolo wadahe kwilongotsa wenyegho. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mne ipfinu pfose ghweghwe imwenyegho uwe chitango cha kutenda ghanoghile. Ulanguse ukweli na ghamalangulitso ghako ghakindike ghendo. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ghaulonga ghaleke kuwa na matotso ghoghose ili iwanebe wako wone chinyala, kwaapfila wahela chochose chihile cha kulonga mne mbuli tsetu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Iwatumwa wawahulikitse iwatwatsa wawo na kuwanoghelesa mne ipfinu pfose. Waleke ukwihisanya nawo, <verse number="10" style="v"/>au ukwiba ipfinu pfawo. Ila walanguse ka wawo wanogha na wa wanu wa kutogholighwa ghamatsuwa ghose, ili waghatende ghamalangulitso ghe Imulungu Mkombotsi wetu ghoneke ghanogha mna chila chinu chawotenda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mana uluso we Imulungu iughala ukombotsi kwe iwanu wose ughubulighwa. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Uluso awo wotulangulitsa kughaleka ghehile na dong'o tse iisi, tukale kwa kwilongotsa iwenyegho, tukale pfinoghile na kukala ka pfayobama Imulungu mne iisi ino ya sambi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>aku twobetetsa litsuwa lila lya kubweda lyatulilolela baho hautsolawila utunitso we Imulungu Mkulu na Mkombotsi wetu Yesu Kiristu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Yeye tsakelapfa imwenyegho kwaajili yetu ili atughombole kulawa mne ghehile ghose na kututenda tuwe iwanu wahenzeluke iwali wake yeye mwenyegho, iwanu iwosulukila kutenda ghanoghile.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Lelo, ulangulitse ipfinu apfo na uwaghume ghumoyo na kuwakanya kwa uwetso wose. Imunu wowose aleke kukubetsa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ukutenda ighanoghile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Uwakumbuse iwanu kuwategheletsa iwakulu na iwanu wane uwetso, kuwahulikitsa na kwiyandaa kutenda ghose ighanoghile, <verse number="2" style="v"/>waleke kumligha imunu wowose, waleke kuwa waghobo, wawalangule iwanu wangi, wawe wahole kwe iwanu wose.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwaapfila aho ghumwande na twetwe tsatukala twawabotsi, ng'atuhulikitse bae, tsatubughighwa, aku twotumikila dong'o na uhondo wose. Tsatukala kwa ukwihila na kwionela chepfu, iwanu tsawatuhila na twetwe tsatuwahila. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lekeni uluso na unoghelo we Imulungu, Mkombotsi wetu haughubulighwe, <verse number="5" style="v"/>tsakatukombola si kwaajili ye ichinu chochose ichinoghile chatutendile twetwe, ila kwa libatsi lyake, kubitila Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka iyotutenda twelekighwe lwa keli na kuwa iwanu wa sambi kwa kutuopfugha. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Imulungu tsakatughalila ghendo Ghumuhe Mwenzeluka kubitila Yesu Kiristu, Mkombotsi wetu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>ili kwa uluso wake tutogholighwe kuwa tunogha na kuubokela ughima wa ghamatsuwa ghose watuulolela. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Imbuli ino yolongesa, nokubama ulonge imbuli ino kwe ingupfu, ili awala iwamtoghole Imulungu wakumbuke kukala mne ghamatendo ghanoghile. Agho ghanogha na ghowatenda iwanu wabwede. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Lekeni kaleni kutali na midawalo ya ubwotsi, na ghamataghwa gha lukolo, ughobo na ukwihisanyila mbuli tsa Ghamalaghitso, kwaapfila pfinu apfo pfahela mana na ng'apfiwapfila bae. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Imunu msongetsi, umkanye mala imwe na ya keli, kuya umleme. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kuya kwomanya imunu ka ayo keyaghitsa na kana nzambi, natso tsomlangusa ka kana matotso.</para>
  <para style="s">Ghamalaghitso gha kumalitsila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Hanitsowatuma Aritema na Tukiko kuna ghweghwe, utende ka pfaudaha utse kuna nene aku Nikapoli, kwaapfila nobama kukala aku ghamatsuwa gha chipfeghetsi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Utende pfaudaha umwapfile mmanya malaghitso Sena na Apolo ili wadahe ukwandusa ghumwanza ghwawo, kuya ulole waleke kuhungukighwa chinu. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iwanu wetu wobamighwa welangulitse kusang'ana ng'onde tsinoghile ili weyapfile wenyegho mna aghala ghawobama, waleke kukala hela.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Iwanu wose iwali na nene wokulamsa. Uwalamse iwanu iwomtoghola Yesu.</para>
  <para style="p">Uluso we Imulungu ukale namwe mwose.</para>
</usx>
